{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28630","headline":"书怀寄卢州 · 杜牧","name":"书怀寄卢州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢山南畔州，风物最宜秋。\n太守悬金印，佳人敞画楼。\n凝缸暗醉夕，残月上汀州。\n可惜当年鬓，朱门不得游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}